    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master spaceflight in this top-down physics game. As you progress through realistic orbital mechanics challenges of increasing complexity, plotting maneuvers will quickly become second nature. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395150/extras/057d798968486af87fff8fd90ba6d67b.poster.avif?t=1748711548\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395150/extras/057d798968486af87fff8fd90ba6d67b.webm?t=1748711548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395150/extras/057d798968486af87fff8fd90ba6d67b.mp4?t=1748711548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Utilize tools like time warp while you coordinate transfer orbits, gravity assists, and high-stakes rendezvous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395150/extras/48a3a6ab4eb348d49827c8161a59594a.poster.avif?t=1748711548\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395150/extras/48a3a6ab4eb348d49827c8161a59594a.webm?t=1748711548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395150/extras/48a3a6ab4eb348d49827c8161a59594a.mp4?t=1748711548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t- Send spacecraft on stable, deterministic trajectories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t- Warp time to speed through lengthy journeys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t- Execute realistic maneuvers like Hohmann and bi-elliptical transfers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t- Plan trajectory intersections and rendezvous with objects in orbit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t- Employ gravity assists to propel spacecraft beyond the pull of the solar system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t- Forgo planning and manually take control of the stick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master spaceflight in this top-down physics game. As you progress through realistic orbital mechanics challenges of increasing complexity, plotting maneuvers will quickly become second nature. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395150/extras/057d798968486af87fff8fd90ba6d67b.poster.avif?t=1748711548\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395150/extras/057d798968486af87fff8fd90ba6d67b.webm?t=1748711548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395150/extras/057d798968486af87fff8fd90ba6d67b.mp4?t=1748711548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Utilize tools like time warp while you coordinate transfer orbits, gravity assists, and high-stakes rendezvous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395150/extras/48a3a6ab4eb348d49827c8161a59594a.poster.avif?t=1748711548\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395150/extras/48a3a6ab4eb348d49827c8161a59594a.webm?t=1748711548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395150/extras/48a3a6ab4eb348d49827c8161a59594a.mp4?t=1748711548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t- Send spacecraft on stable, deterministic trajectories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t- Warp time to speed through lengthy journeys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t- Execute realistic maneuvers like Hohmann and bi-elliptical transfers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t- Plan trajectory intersections and rendezvous with objects in orbit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t- Employ gravity assists to propel spacecraft beyond the pull of the solar system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t- Forgo planning and manually take control of the stick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
